# SYNTHESISED to pin the types view's tie-break, which no other fixture can
# reach: model.JoinByResourceType ranks by UI total and breaks ties by RPC
# total, and every other fixture's UI totals are distinct, so the tie-break
# never runs. Both types here total 2s of UI-hook time and differ only in
# RPC time, so the join's own order (aws_zulu first, on 500ms of RPC) is
# the opposite of what ranking by UI total and breaking ties by NAME would
# give (aws_alpha first). That disagreement is the point: it is what lets a
# test tell the builder's order apart from a generic re-sort of it.
#
# The hclog lines follow testdata/provider-rpc.log's "Received downstream
# response" shape; the terraform.ui JSON lines follow
# testdata/structured-ui.log's apply_start/apply_complete shape. Values are
# invented; no line here is from a real run. Both elapsed_seconds are WHOLE
# numbers, as a real log's always are.
